{
 "id": "usb16",
 "order": 4,
 "name": "16-channel USB audio (A+M / A16 / MID)",
 "description": [
  "16-channel USB audio, switchable in CONFIG > DEVICE > USB MODE:",
  "  A+M  stock: the stereo mix and MIDI (default after flashing)",
  "  A16  16 channels and MIDI: T1..T6 as L/R pairs after VOL and PAN, then delay return L/R and reverb return L/R",
  "  MID  MIDI only",
  "The channels are named on the host (T1 L ... Reverb R); 48 kHz, 24 bit.",
  "Based on ms-multi-output by Scott Metoyer (MIT) and the work on it in Modded-Cycles by 18nelli."
